   "versionNonce": 745188127,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "S = Q K^T / sqrt(d_h)       S in R^(T x T)\nT = 100,000   ->   T x T = 10^10 scores\nFP16: 10^10 x 2 B = 20 GB  per head, per layer\nStandard: write S to HBM, read it back for softmax,\n          write P, read it again for P V\nFlashAttention: S never exists in HBM",
   "originalText": "S = Q K^T / sqrt(d_h)       S in R^(T x T)\nT = 100,000   ->   T x T = 10^10 scores\nFP16: 10^10 x 2 B = 20 GB  per head, per layer\nStandard: write S to HBM, read it back for softmax,\n          write P, read it again for P V\nFlashAttention: S never exists in HBM",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "e77",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
