   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "e172",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 20,
   "y": 1483,
   "width": 1012.0,
   "height": 37.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 2115112582,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1628484994,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Example B_r = B_c = 64, d_h = 128: Q_i, K_j, V_j = 16 KiB each (FP16), S_ij = 16 KiB (FP32), O_i = 32 KiB (FP32)\n=> ~96 KiB on-chip. HBM traffic: Q and O touched once, K and V streamed once per Q tile, no T x T write.",
   "originalText": "Example B_r = B_c = 64, d_h = 128: Q_i, K_j, V_j = 16 KiB each (FP16), S_ij = 16 KiB (FP32), O_i = 32 KiB (FP32)\n=> ~96 KiB on-chip. HBM traffic: Q and O touched once, K and V streamed once per Q tile, no T x T write.",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "e173",
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 1600,
   "y": 1030,
   "width": 1000,
   "height": 263.75,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": {
    "type": 3
   },
   "seed": 1831006406,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 419072900,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "id": "e174"
    }
   ],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false
  },
  {
   "id": "e174",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1610,
   "y": 1045.0,
   "width": 616.0,
   "height": 233.75,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1731040586,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 514081107,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Online softmax for one Q tile i   (rows = B_r)\ninit:  m = -inf    l = 0    O = 0\nfor j = 1 .. T / B_c:                  # stream K_j, V_j\n    S  = Q_i K_j^T / sqrt(d_h)         (B_r x B_c)\n    m' = max( m , rowmax(S) )          new running max\n    P  = exp( S - m' )                 (B_r x B_c)\n    a  = exp( m - m' )                 rescale factor\n    l  = a * l + rowsum(P)             running denominator\n    O  = a * O + P V_j                 (B_r x d_h)\n    m  = m'\nO_i = O / l                            write O_i to HBM once",
   "originalText": "Online softmax for one Q tile i   (rows = B_r)\ninit:  m = -inf    l = 0    O = 0\nfor j = 1 .. T / B_c:                  # stream K_j, V_j\n    S  = Q_i K_j^T / sqrt(d_h)         (B_r x B_c)\n    m' = max( m , rowmax(S) )          new running max\n    P  = exp( S - m' )                 (B_r x B_c)\n    a  = exp( m - m' )                 rescale factor\n    l  = a * l + rowsum(P)             running denominator\n    O  = a * O + P V_j                 (B_r x d_h)\n    m  = m'\nO_i = O / l                            write O_i to HBM once",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "e173",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "e175",
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 1600,
   "y": 1320,
   "width": 1000,
   "height": 115.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": {
    "type": 3
   },
   "seed": 1757356620,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 860463132,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "id": "e176"
    }
   ],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false
  },
  {
   "id": "e176",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1610,
   "y": 1335.0,
   "width": 752.0000000000001,
   "height": 85.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1588865204,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1725129599,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Why rescale?  When a larger max appears, everything accumulated so far was\ncomputed against the OLD max. Multiplying l and O by a = exp(m - m') re-bases\nit to the new max. The final O_i = softmax(S) V is EXACT - not an approximation.\nOnly m, l (B_r numbers) are carried between tiles - never the T x T matrix.",
   "originalText": "Why rescale?  When a larger max appears, everything accumulated so far was\ncomputed against the OLD max. Multiplying l and O by a = exp(m - m') re-bases\nit to the new max. The final O_i = softmax(S) V is EXACT - not an approximation.\nOnly m, l (B_r numbers) are carried between tiles - never the T x T matrix.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "e175",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
