   "text": "ring: each GPU passes its K,V block to its neighbour while computing on the one it holds (overlap comm with compute)",
   "originalText": "ring: each GPU passes its K,V block to its neighbour while computing on the one it holds (overlap comm with compute)",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
